WEBVTT

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.510
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.950
takaku habatake
Soar high up

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.890
oozora o dokomademo
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.450
Shining Finger

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.120
kagayaku hikari ga
The shining light

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.520
chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell
A spell that spreads miracles
throughout the world

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:21.060
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.730
furimukazu aruku no sa
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:34.300
mugen no chikara ga aru
I have an unlimited power

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:40.640
nando demo tamesu no sa
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:48.760
donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.990
ai wa itsumo kono mune ni
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:55.600
towa ni kieru koto wa nai
It will never fade

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.430
kono te ga sakendeiru
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:02.700
ashita e to hashire
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.400
Bright you now

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.710
kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa
The future that you envision

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.150
Shining Finger

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.810
yume o tsukamou
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:16.870
subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance
Everything will go my way if
I get a chance

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:27.430
Area 6-3-5, checked.

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.660
Magnetic storm that had developed
at time 5-0-0...

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:31.930
...estimated to subside in 3 days.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:34.870
Deploying energy shield
to Area 2-3.

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.740
All green in every direction.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.810
Mark system...

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:39.310
Checked.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:40.980
Good work.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.770
Again, another day, no incident.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.550
We rarely have anyone
come out this far in space...

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:48.650
...so it hasn't been
very challenging.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.990
And we've only got another week.

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:52.250
Right.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.850
We'll finally say goodbye
to this boring security station.

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.160
I know it's been
pretty lonely out here.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.900
But once we get
back to the Colony...

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.420
...we can think of
starting a family.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.390
Oh, Andy!

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:09.740
What's this?

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:11.970
Object approaching.

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:14.000
On a collision course
with this station.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.140
A-a pirate ship?!

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:43.870
Now, this event five years ago
will affect today's Gundam Fight.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.310
However...

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.680
...how exactly does this tragedy
tie in with Domon Kasshu?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.580
Also, will Domon be able
to get a lead on Kyoji...

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.910
...the brother who descended to
Earth with the Devil Gundam?

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.380
It all depends...

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.320
Neo Canada - Lumber Gundam
...on the outcome with
today's opponent...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.350
Neo Canada - Lumber Gundam
...Neo Canada's Lumber Gundam.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.260
And now!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:07.520
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.230
An Old Grudge!
Revenge of the Space Police

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:13.690
An Old Grudge!
Revenge of the Space Police.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.520
But why?!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.920
We're here at Niagara Falls!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.790
Why can't I take just a moment
to enjoy the view?!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.460
Cut it out!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.460
My only objective is
to face Neo Canada's Gundam!

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.900
I'm not here for sightseeing!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.530
Why do you have to be that way?!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.300
You're exhausted.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.170
It'll be good to take a short break.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.400
Don't lecture me!

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.270
All right.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.900
I'm not speaking to you again.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.980
That's it, huh?

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:01.620
You're lucky you have
an easy way out.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.410
But, from my standpoint...

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.350
I'm sorry.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.190
But I've been trying my best to...

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.130
Shut up! That's it for us!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:14.260
From here on, I'll go it alone.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.670
Fine.
Do it if you can!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.900
I didn't become your partner
because I wanted to, anyway!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.680
I take it you're Domon Kasshu
from Neo Japan.

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:35.250
You may know my name,
Andrew Graham...

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.150
I'm the Gundam Fighter
from Neo Canada.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:49.050
Domon makes me so angry.
Why is he so mean?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.170
Domon?

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.660
What's he doing?

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:02.410
What?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.210
Argo's on his way here?!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.240
That's right.

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:10.680
After you defeated them,
Neo Russia changed their strategy.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:15.420
They're now taking the initiative
to take down as many as possible.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.190
And their first target...

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.760
...is Neo Canada.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:20.930
So?

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:24.300
Are you saying we join forces
and defeat Neo Russia together?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.800
Exactly.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.640
I want all the data you have
on the Bolt Gundam.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.800
What the...?!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:33.310
We come here to find you
and all you do is ignore us?!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.480
That's right.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.240
I'm only interested
in fighting Neo Russia.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:40.550
When I'm finished, I'll hand over
my Gundam's head to you.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:43.240
If that's the case,
will you oblige me?

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:46.490
I don't like your attitude.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.080
Then what'll you do?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.890
Here's what I'll do!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.050
Shining Gundam!

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:09.140
What's he up to?

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.410
Why is he calling out
the Gundam?!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:20.880
Let's go! Lumber Gundam!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:27.330
That's the Gundam
from Neo Canada?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.060
But...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.770
Now! You will fight me!

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:34.070
We'll talk after that!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.270
Gundam Fight!

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.500
Ready...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.340
I refuse.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.170
What?!

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.210
Like I said...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.910
...I don't want to take you on
in an official Fight.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.040
I'm asking you...

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.410
Give me the information on
Bolt Gundam!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.280
Don't be stupid!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.990
What? He vanished?

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.450
Where is he?!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:08.830
Are you there?!

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:16.540
Damn...!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.290
What brutal power!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.200
Domon?!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.800
Domon Kasshu,
the King of Hearts...

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.790
...isn't likely to be killed
that easily.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.240
You must be Domon's partner.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.680
What are you going to do with me?

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.750
I don't want to go ahead
with this.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.390
But I have no choice.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:07:59.750
Domon Kasshu!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.890
When you decide to give me
the data on the Bolt Gundam...

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.990
...come to the Rocky Mountains.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.650
I'll keep the girl until then.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:12.590
Rain...

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.990
Domon!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.830
R-Rain!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:36.920
What?

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:39.190
Domon Kasshu of Neo Japan
is here?

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:40.190
Yes.

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:45.130
He was in an unofficial match
with Neo Canada at Niagara Falls.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:48.900
That man can be unpredictable.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.940
Go to Security Alert 1!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.070
Huh?

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.910
You're overreacting, aren't you?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.420
Domon Kasshu?

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:08.120
I wanted to surprise you a little.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.320
But I guess I overdid it.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.660
Argo! Capture that man!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.250
Hey, you're looking well.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.340
What's wrong, Argo?!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.670
Not getting any exercise
at the prison?

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:32.840
Excellent!

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.940
That's more like it.

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.520
Here goes!

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.530
Andrew Graham?

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.200
Is that the opponent's name?

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.310
Yeah.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.040
I don't know the reason...

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:03.670
...but he's taken a great
personal interest in you guys.

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:07.410
So...

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.750
...you wanted to test your skills
on Argo...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.450
...to be better prepared the next
time you meet this Andrew.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:17.690
There aren't many Fighters around
with the strength Andrew has.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:22.160
Not to mention, he also nabbed
your partner, Rain Mikamura.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.400
She's no longer my partner.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.300
I see.

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:29.170
Very well. I will cooperate.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.120
I'm sorry for forcing you
to come with me.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.390
But I need you to stick around
a little longer.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.620
You're out of your mind.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.190
What's the purpose behind this?

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.820
Purpose, huh?

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:55.430
I have only one.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:59.370
To kill Argo Gulskii
with my own hands.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.340
K-kill him?!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.030
But the International Regulations...

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.270
This isn't a match!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.800
It's judgment!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.400
Judgment?

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.880
That's right.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.780
Against a man who killed my wife.

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:26.410
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.170
He used to be a detective?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.240
But because of one incident...

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:39.910
...he decided to quit
the Space Police...

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:43.840
...in order to devote his life
to hunting down one man.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.410
A former space pirate called...

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.210
...Argo Gulskii.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.480
His sworn enemy.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:50.720
Yes.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.410
It seems like ages ago.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.820
Andrew and his wife were working
alone at a space security station.

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:00.760
Their assignment was to end
in a week.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:06.250
It was then that Argo's pirate ship
attacked the station.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.240
Norma!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:12.070
Andy!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.610
Norma!
Hold on! Don't you let go!

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:19.350
Help!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.280
Norma!

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:24.150
The two were desperate
to get through this.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:26.050
- Norma!
- Andy!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.750
But, just then...

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:37.220
...a man stepped in between them.

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:43.060
Norma!

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:55.820
Then later...

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.780
...I was fortunately picked up...

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.510
...by a security fleet
patrolling the area.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.390
However...

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:04.220
...when I regained consciousness...

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.560
...there before me was the station,
scorched and laying in ruins.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.960
There was no one inside.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.700
But...

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:17.760
...the image of my wife
remains etched in my mind.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:24.430
And the man who took her away...

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.680
...Argo Gulskii.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.790
I promised myself.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.520
That I would track him down
and avenge the death of my wife.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:38.460
Then I heard he was caught...

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.500
...and became the
Gundam Fighter for Neo Russia.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.120
I told myself...

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.800
...that this was my opportunity...

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.440
...to punish him for his crimes
with my own hands!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.640
You became a Gundam Fighter
for that?

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.310
What's strange about that?!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.240
Now that he's a Fighter...

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.740
...there's just no other way!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.940
But...

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.610
He's here.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:07.220
I no longer need you!
You're free to leave!

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:08.590
Wait a minute!

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.490
Do you really plan on
killing Argo?!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.890
Despite your reasons...

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:16.300
...the rules say that it's a violation
to directly attack another Fighter!

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:19.170
And you'll be charged with murder!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.460
You think your wife would be
happy if...

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.840
You're not to interfere.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.900
This is none of your concern.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.740
B-but I...

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:34.040
First you take me hostage,
then you do this!

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.020
There's the man who's
out for revenge.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.730
Well...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.030
Domon Kasshu's been awfully
faithful.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:52.970
It's all right.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.500
I don't care if you both
want to come at me!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.770
Now...

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.710
...in gratitude for bringing you here...

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:02.040
...you'll let me fight him first,
as you promised...

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.110
Afterward, you can fight
the one left standing.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:08.280
It's a strategy that favors you,
and suits your style.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.780
There's one thing
that's troubling me.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.750
In his pirate days...

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.320
...Argo had never taken a life.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.890
And we have a woman
who wasn't resisting.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.760
What're you getting at?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.090
Argo!

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.530
Don't get in my way.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.930
This Fight is personal!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:29.800
What the...?!
You're ignoring orders!

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.930
Stop your Gundam!

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.240
Argo!

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:38.070
Looks like I got the easier job.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.020
We finally meet, Argo Gulskii!

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:53.390
You can't imagine how long
I've waited for this day.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.870
I can see you're ready to fight.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.300
This is my chance
to avenge my wife!

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:02.700
Stop it!

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.540
What are you trying to do?!

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:07.570
That's obvious, isn't it?!

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.510
I can't sit back while you
plan to kill someone!

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.110
Please think this over!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.480
You won't gain anything
from destroying each other!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:17.250
What?! Rain's in there?!

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.790
Do you think your wife would be
happy if she saw you do this?

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:24.320
Can't you see this doesn't
solve anything at all?!

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:25.890
I'm sorry.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:28.950
My wife was a kind woman,
just like you.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:34.730
I'm sorry.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.990
Let's do it! Argo!

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.750
The Fight has already started!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:58.750
Rain's in there.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.520
Gundam!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.430
Stop, both of you!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.070
Don't you interfere!

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.950
This is for what you did
to my poor Norma.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.490
Take this!

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:27.750
Stop it!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.090
What?

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.030
If you're going to help Argo Gulskii...

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.290
...then you are my enemy as well!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.200
You can't always have things
your way!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.170
I've come up with a new weapon.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.840
Oblige me and let me try it on you!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:46.970
Then do it!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.620
What?

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:14.330
This hand of mine glows
with an awesome power!

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:17.340
Its burning grip tells me
to defeat you!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.570
The ultimate...

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:24.570
Shining Finger!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.720
He's breaking the rules
by attacking the cockpit!

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:37.890
No. This is not an
official Gundam Fight.

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:39.620
But for us...

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.330
Rain!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.600
Rain! Are you okay?!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.370
D-Domon...

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:55.610
Wait there! I'll get you out!

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.040
Domon...

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.350
A draw?!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:07.910
Rain!

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:15.600
I'm sorry.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:19.270
I'm really sorry things
turned out this way.

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:23.670
I've done to you exactly
what Argo did to us back then.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.210
It doesn't matter who wins.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:29.010
All that'll remain are
anger and sorrow.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:29.840
Rain!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:33.670
I'm sorry.
I have been such a fool.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.450
Argo!

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:45.020
No! Stop it!

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:47.290
Rain's still trapped inside!

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:51.500
You've already won the bout!
It's over! Please!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.600
If you're not satisfied
defeating Andrew...

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:56.470
...then I'll gladly offer
Shining Gundam's head to you!

00:19:56.470 --> 00:20:01.840
So, please! Please, spare Rain!

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:03.370
Domon...

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.950
Here we are.
This is just like that incident.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.850
But now you won't have anyone
wanting revenge.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.090
That's right.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:16.760
From now on,
you can sleep soundly.

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.930
Do it. Go ahead.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:21.090
Get rid of me now.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:29.670
Wh-why?

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:31.170
You're saving me?

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.140
Argo Gulskii!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:36.940
It all makes sense.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.560
Why, Argo?

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.530
If you save my life...

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.730
...I'll only keep coming after you.

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.570
Listen.

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:05.230
I read a report sent to me by
my government about that incident.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:09.410
It said that the
United Police Force...

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:11.710
...forced Argo's ship into your station...

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:14.280
...resulting in that accident.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:15.780
You're saying it was an accident?!

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:17.350
That's correct.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:22.520
Also, Argo had no intention
of getting rid of your wife.

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:27.430
That can't be...!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.500
Argo was actually trying to
save my poor Norma?!

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.530
I will never forget that day either...

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:35.230
Despite my intentions...

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.140
...your wife was lost
because of me.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:39.270
That's right.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.810
If you want revenge, come get me.

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:43.510
I will win the Gundam Fight.

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:47.050
I will continue fighting
to have my friends released.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:50.480
Until then, I won't run or hide.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:22:00.630
Do you think that man will keep
pursuing Argo until the finals?

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:01.590
I don't know.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.630
It's up to him.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:07.030
It all depends on whether or not
he can put revenge behind him.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:08.070
But...

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:11.270
...once happiness is gone,
it will never return.

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:13.830
That's true of anybody.

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:33.430
Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:37.660
tadori tsukenu basho o
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:42.030
samayoi motomenagara
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:45.670
aruite yuku
I keep going forward

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:53.110
koibito yo, watashi no
hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:58.280
kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.520 --> 00:23:03.690
dore hodo tsutawaru no desho
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:10.460
Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:14.430
atataka na kono mune de
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.430 --> 00:23:20.670
umi yori mo fukaku nemutte
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:35.860
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:37.490
Domon's next opponent...

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:40.330
...is the winner of three consecutive
Gundam Fight championships...

00:23:40.330 --> 00:23:43.160
...the veteran Fighter Chapman!

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:46.030
His superior tactics help
to defeat George...

00:23:46.030 --> 00:23:49.200
...and demonstrate to Domon
the destiny of a warrior.

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:52.710
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.710 --> 00:23:54.670
Powerful Enemy!
Chapman's Heroic Challenge.

00:23:54.670 --> 00:23:56.380
Powerful Enemy!
Chapman's Heroic Challenge

00:23:56.380 --> 00:23:59.780
Powerful Enemy!
Chapman's Heroic Challenge
Ready! Go!

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:00.640
Powerful Enemy!
Chapman's Heroic Challenge
